    12                              <1> ; playCompletionSound — main entry
    13                              <1> ; ---------------------------------------
    14                              <1> playCompletionSound:
    15 00000628 50                  <1>     push ax
    16 00000629 53                  <1>     push bx
    17 0000062A 51                  <1>     push cx
    18 0000062B 52                  <1>     push dx
    19 0000062C 56                  <1>     push si
    20                              <1> 
